Package: cohortguard
Type: Package
Title: Label-Free Audit of Transcriptomic Signature Transferability
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Yuxuan", "Li", email = "liyx1326@mails.jlu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Audits whether a transcriptomic classifier will transfer to a new
    cohort before validation labels are available. Provides two drift measures
    (kernel MMD and model-agreement drift), split-conformal prediction sets with
    abstention, the AUC@coverage metric, and readers for GEO series-matrix and
    platform annotation files.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: stats, utils
Suggests: testthat
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
